    positioned anywhere within its quadrant (surrounded by background)
  output:
    always 6x6 -- four 3x3 sprite crops packed in 2x2 layout
    UL/UR/LL/LR quadrant order preserved

generation_strategy:
  approach: output-first
  steps:
    1. Generate four 3x3 sprites, each a single distinct color on bg=0, with 4-6 filled cells each
    2. Pack them into a 6x6 output grid (UL, UR, LL, LR)
